@description AHS classroom migration: ReaPackLabSetup (replaces standard ReaPack; install only when instructed)
@author ReaLab
@version 0.1.2
@changelog
  Temporary classroom deployment of the existing signed ReaPackLabSetup v0.1.2 release.
  Recovery Setup can refresh an already-loaded older ReaPackLab and supports hosted configuration bootstrap through ReaPackLab v0.14.4.
  macOS 15.0+ Apple Silicon (ARM64). Signed, not notarized.
@provides
  [darwin-arm64] reaper_reapacklabsetup-arm64.dylib https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLabSetup/releases/download/v$version/$path
@link
  Official ReaPackLabSetup distribution https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLabSetup
  Managed ReaPackLab extension https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLab
@about
  # AHS classroom migration: ReaPackLabSetup

  **For classroom deployment only, when specifically instructed by the administrator.**

  This temporary AHS package installs the exact signed ReaPackLabSetup v0.1.2
  binary published in the official ReaPackLabSetup repository.

  Setup downloads the most recent approved ReaPackLab release, including
  an update when an older ReaPackLab extension is already installed.
  ReaPackLab v0.14.4 obtains its managed configuration address through
  the hosted ReaPackLab-Config/bootstrap-url.txt pointer, bypassing
  an incorrectly populated local url.txt on standard macOS installs.

  Intended for macOS 15.0+ Apple Silicon (ARM64). Signed, not notarized.
  Restart REAPER when required. Installing initiates migration to centrally
  managed ReaPackLab; do not install unless your administrator directs you.
